                                "sense_id": "fba0da1b-b938-3915-8147-6623d537667c",
                                "text": "Then he told of what implements were necessary, how many assistants (two), how many nurses (four), the kinds of bandages, needles, silk and catgut thread, knives, clamp dilators, rubber gloves.",
